{"seq":4,"slug":"scale-operations","title":"规模化运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/scale-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bulk-import-etl","title":"批量导入与 ETL 管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/scale-operations/bulk-import-etl","wordCount":1626,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"catalog-versioning-governance","title":"目录版本控制与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/scale-operations/catalog-versioning-governance","wordCount":1589,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"internationalization-localization","title":"国际化与本地化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-catalog-pim/scale-operations/internationalization-localization","wordCount":1776,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 规模化运营\n\n当商品目录从几千个 SKU 增长到百万级，日常运营的复杂度会发生质变。本章关注三个规模化场景下的工程实践：批量导入与 ETL 管线——如何安全高效地将供应商数据、ERP 主数据批量注入目录系统；版本控制与治理——如何在多人协作、多渠道发布的场景下保持变更可追溯、可回滚；国际化与本地化——如何在一个统一数据模型上管理多语言、多币种、多度量单位的商品内容。\n\n这三篇文档面向已经度过 MVP 阶段、正在应对规模化挑战的工程团队。\n"}